  "description": "Variation of Condition 12 (opening hours) attached to permission 2020/0506 dated 03/09/2020 to extend the permitted opening hours of commercial premises at Unit 9 Rosewood Building",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Deliveries and Servicing of the site shall be carried out in\r\n accordance with the details approved under reference 2021/3681\r\n dated 29/05/19 and the Delivery and Servicing Management Plan\r\n and Noise Report hereby approved. On-street deliveries shall not\r\n take place between the hours of 23:00 and 07:00 on any day.\r\n REASON: In order to ensure that delivery and servicing does not\r\n impact the amenity of neighbouring occupiers and the safe and\r\n efficient operation of the highway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In order to ensure that delivery and servicing does not impact the amenity of neighbouring occupiers and the safe and efficient operation of the highway.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-854dc088-7fff-ce02-8138-4d4597471ff9&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Unit 9 Rosewood Building hereby permitted shall only be open to the public between 06:00 and 20:00 hours Monday to Saturday (including Bank Holidays) and Sundays 09:00 to 17:00 hours. With the exception of Unit 3A (2021/3681) and Unit 9 Rosewood Building, any retail use (A1) hereby permitted shall only be open to the public between 08:00 and 22:00 hours Monday to Saturday and 08:00–21:00 hours on Sundays, unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
